### Pedido con stock (201 CONFIRMADO)
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "P001", "quantity": 2, "customerEmail": "ana@example.com" }

### Pedido sin stock (409 RECHAZADO)
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "P002", "quantity": 1, "customerEmail": "ana@example.com" }

### Producto inexistente (404)
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "P999", "quantity": 1, "customerEmail": "ana@example.com" }

### Listar pedidos
GET http://localhost:3000/orders

### Consultar disponibilidad directamente en Inventory
GET http://localhost:3001/inventory/P003/availability?quantity=5

### Inventario completo
GET http://localhost:3001/inventory
